To overload the function call operator in a class, define a member function named operator() with the desired parameters and return type. For example:

class FunctorClass {
public:
    return_type operator()(parameter_list) const {  // Use 'const' for immutability where possible
        // Implementation code
    }
};  // Practical note: Make it const to allow use with const objects and in multi-threaded contexts.
